<p>You fire a pinning shot, doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">117%, 125%, 130%, 135%, 140%</acronym> damage and pinning your target to the ground for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 4, 5</acronym> turns.</p><p>The pinning chance increases with your Dexterity.</p>